//! env/dotenv — dotenv-compatible environment files (`*.nv.env`).
//!
//! Status: runnable M4 surface (ADR-017: `KEY=VALUE` syntax, blank
//! lines and `#` comments ignored, process environment always wins).
//! Parsing and mutation live in `dotenv_load_builtin` (one place,
//! shared with `noct run`'s auto-load); this module is the typed
//! surface over it.

/// Load `KEY=VALUE` pairs from `path` into the process environment.
/// Existing variables are never overwritten (process wins).
/// Returns how many variables were set.
fn dotenv_load(path: String) -> Result<Int, String>:
    dotenv_load_builtin(path)
